# 🚀 Shopify AI Marketing Intelligence Platform

## 📌 Overview
The **Shopify AI Marketing Intelligence Platform** is a full-stack SaaS application that transforms raw Shopify data into actionable marketing insights using AI, Machine Learning, and Data Analytics.

It helps e-commerce businesses make smarter decisions by analyzing customer behavior, marketing performance, and revenue trends beyond default Shopify analytics.

---

## 🎯 Problem Statement
Many e-commerce businesses struggle to interpret large volumes of sales and customer data, limiting their ability to make data-driven marketing decisions.

---

## 💡 Solution
This platform integrates with Shopify stores to:
- Analyze sales, customer, and product data
- Track marketing performance
- Generate AI-powered insights
- Provide optimization recommendations

---

## 📈 Expected Impact
- Improve ROAS (Return on Ad Spend)
- Increase revenue growth
- Enhance customer retention
- Optimize marketing strategies

---

