## ⚙️ Setup Instructions

### 1. Clone Repository
git clone https://github.com/your-repo/shopify-ai-platform.git  
cd shopify-ai-platform  

### 2. Install Dependencies
npm install  

### 3. Setup Environment Variables (.env)
SHOPIFY_API_KEY=  
SHOPIFY_API_SECRET=  
DATABASE_URL=  
JWT_SECRET=  
OPENAI_API_KEY=  

### 4. Run Development Server
npm run dev  

